# Zerodha

> Zerodha is India's largest stock broker based on net worth as per NSE, trusted by 1.7+ crore customers with ~ ₹7 lakh crores invested. It provides free account opening, zero brokerage on equity investments, trading in futures, options, commodities, and currencies, direct mutual fund investments, fixed deposits, National Pension System (NPS) investments, and free financial education through Varsity.

## Core Trading Platforms & Products
- [Zerodha Home](https://zerodha.com/): Primary online platform for stock trading, demat account opening, and investment solutions.
- [Products Overview](https://zerodha.com/products/): Suite of trading platforms, financial tools, and investment APIs.
- [Kite Web & App](https://kite.zerodha.com): Flagship trading platform offering real-time streaming data, advanced charts (ChartIQ and TradingView), order execution, and market depth analytics.
- [Coin](https://coin.zerodha.com): Zero-commission direct mutual fund investment platform for lumpsum and SIP investments.
- [Console](https://console.zerodha.com): Central dashboard for portfolio reporting, tax P&L statements, trade books, dividend tracking, and corporate actions.
- [Kite Connect API](https://zerodha.com/products/api/): RESTful APIs allowing developers, quants, and fintech startups to automate trades, fetch real-time market data, and build custom investment apps.

## Account Opening
- [Open Individual Account](https://zerodha.com/open-account/): Open an individual Demat and trading account online via digital eSign.
- [Open Minor Account](https://zerodha.com/open-account/minor/): Open a Demat and trading account for a minor under legal guardianship.
- [Open NRI Account](https://zerodha.com/open-account/nri/): Open an NRE or NRO Demat and trading account for Non-Resident Indians(NRI).
- [Open HUF Account](https://zerodha.com/open-account/huf/): Open a Demat and trading account for a Hindu Undivided Family (HUF).

## Trading Services, Margin & Transfers
- [Commodities Trading](https://zerodha.com/commodities/): Trading MCX futures and options contracts across metals, energy, and agri commodities.
- [Margin Trading Facility (MTF)](https://zerodha.com/mtf/): Pay-later facility allowing users to hold equity delivery positions with leverage.
- [Fund Transfers](https://zerodha.com/fund-transfer/): Deposit and withdrawal pathways via UPI, Netbanking, IMPS, NEFT, and RTGS.
- [Dematerialisation Process](https://zerodha.com/dematerialise/): Converting physical share certificates into digital demat holdings.

## Markets, Intel & Tools
- [Stock Market Search & Analysis](https://zerodha.com/markets/stocks/): Directory tool to search, track, and analyze individual stocks listed on the NSE and BSE.
- [IPO Platform](https://zerodha.com/ipo/): Live portal to track and apply for current, upcoming, and past Initial Public Offerings (IPOs).
- [Holiday Calendar](https://zerodha.com/marketintel/holiday-calendar/): Trading and clearing settlement holiday schedule for NSE, BSE, and MCX.
- [Zerodha Bulletin](https://zerodha.com/marketintel/bulletin/): Live operational announcements, intraday leverage updates, surveillance measures, and trading alerts.

## Calculators & Pricing
- [Financial Calculators Hub](https://zerodha.com/calculators/): Comprehensive suite of investment tools, including SIP, MTF, NPS, fixed deposit and retirement calculators.
- [Pricing & Charges](https://zerodha.com/charges/): Transparent fee schedule detailing zero account opening charges, zero brokerage for equity delivery, and ₹20/trade flat pricing for F&O, intraday, and currencies.
- [Brokerage Calculator](https://zerodha.com/brokerage-calculator/): Calculator to estimate total transaction costs including STT, GST, stamp duty, exchange turnover charges, and net P&L.
- [Margin Calculator](https://zerodha.com/margin-calculator/): Real-time margin requirement calculator for multi-leg option strategies and futures positions.

## Market Intel & Community
- [Z-Connect](https://zerodha.com/z-connect/): Official company blog sharing platform updates, regulatory changes, business metrics, and market telemetry.
- [TradingQnA](https://tradingqna.com): Open discussion forum for Indian retail traders, investors, and market enthusiasts.
- [Pulse](https://pulse.zerodha.com/): Financial news aggregator collecting live market headlines across major Indian news outlets.
- [Referral Program](https://zerodha.com/refer/): Client referral program details, reward points, and brokerage revenue sharing rules.

